{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/f29094dc87f5400ab2e7aa8d5ff757e8.poster.avif?t=1752219675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/f29094dc87f5400ab2e7aa8d5ff757e8.webm?t=1752219675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/f29094dc87f5400ab2e7aa8d5ff757e8.mp4?t=1752219675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You\u2019re looking at the weird game with obscure visual style inspired by the hack\u2019n\u2019slash projects. <br>Under no external funding.<br><br>It\u2019s a top game. It has a Steam page.<br><br>The description in if-it-was-a-AAA-project style is below:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/cadbe09259e2a480bd7ccf35459e3aec.avif?t=1752219675\" width=600 height=104 /></span><br><u><strong>Endless Boss Fight</strong></u> is an action-adventure third person game with some elements of hack 'n' slash.<br>Will you dare snatch victory from the jaws of defeat? No one knows but Her.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/cadbe09259e2a480bd7ccf35459e3aec.avif?t=1752219675\" width=600 height=104 /></span><br>She knew you would come. <br>She studied you, your weaknesses, your obsessions. And you?<br><strong>You walked straight into her trap, like a toddler.</strong><br>And now she'll do whatever to make the daylight fade for you forever. She has everything in the palm of her hand. <br><strong>And you are not an exception.</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/8bbd225a9f448e69c630f749ff550d9f.avif?t=1752219675\" width=600 height=104 /></span><br>Study your enemy, unravel their wills, interfere their moves.<br><strong>Act faster:</strong> breath in the sweet air of victory and feel the bitter sting of defeat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/1a4c1a6b49302fceeddc20a9f8190829.poster.avif?t=1752219675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/1a4c1a6b49302fceeddc20a9f8190829.webm?t=1752219675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/1a4c1a6b49302fceeddc20a9f8190829.mp4?t=1752219675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Astra will never let you go, she is just mocking you.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/9c8b8a110ae77066eea6bc7a80ba4ba0.avif?t=1752219675\" width=600 height=104 /></span><br>Astra's strength grows with each of your victories.<br>Take tactical moves and choose your next step wisely if you still hope to get out of her trap...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/c4d49e6776776ceba0371835eb03c2b5.poster.avif?t=1752219675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/c4d49e6776776ceba0371835eb03c2b5.webm?t=1752219675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/c4d49e6776776ceba0371835eb03c2b5.mp4?t=1752219675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>She is treacherous, deceitful and lying. She has many aces up her sleeve. <br><strong>Be attentive:</strong> maybe it's not only about physical strength?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/a16f336f5ba91a648584b25771d91ba5.avif?t=1752219675\" width=600 height=104 /></span><br><strong>Face it, she is way cooler than you.</strong><br>You never know where she will take you...<br>To the snow-covered mountains or to the burning netherworld...?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/16ead5210ba1d45a9647da8f485bf702.poster.avif?t=1752219675\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/16ead5210ba1d45a9647da8f485bf702.webm?t=1752219675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1676150/extras/16ead5210ba1d45a9647da8f485bf702.mp4?t=1752219675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You never know what senses she will deprive you of...<br>Of vision? Or maybe of self-control?<br><br><strong>She is playing with you. Will you dare win the game without rules of yours?</strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Speleologist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1676150/f0cca0c23de96ae1ae50a5e6bc873c864c5a9300.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure ahead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1676150/f0cca0c23de96ae1ae50a5e6bc873c864c5a9300.jpg"},{"name":"Burned by lava","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1676150/2fcdb95248cfbfd75dcc94e3de70d4aecfc61698.jpg"},{"name":"Death vortex","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1676150/2fcdb95248cfbfd75dcc94e3de70d